          "short": "$55\\text{ m}^2$",
          "worked": "The sloping section is $25-10=15\\text{ m}$ long.\n$\\begin{aligned}A_1&=\\frac{1.5+2.5}{2}\\times15\\\\A_1&=30\\text{ m}^2\\\\A_2&=2.5\\times10\\\\A_2&=25\\text{ m}^2\\\\A&=30+25\\\\A&=55\\text{ m}^2\\end{aligned}$",
